WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:03.880
- Women who achieved
something in their lives,

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:07.651
and got somewhere, have a responsibility

00:00:07.651 --> 00:00:10.234
to educate the next generation.

00:00:12.421 --> 00:00:14.880
(pounding electronic dance music)

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.731
I would love my music to
be something that would

00:00:16.731 --> 00:00:20.898
entertain while giving a
moment of thought to people,

00:00:23.131 --> 00:00:26.964
because that's something
that music did to me.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:37.832
My name is Noga Erez; I'm a musician,

00:00:37.832 --> 00:00:42.399
electronic singer-songwriter,
producer from Israel.

00:00:42.399 --> 00:00:45.731
There is a very, very
strong feminine voice

00:00:45.731 --> 00:00:47.880
in electronic music here.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:51.130
A lot of women in Tel Aviv are badass.

00:00:53.552 --> 00:00:57.101
Israel has been a huge
inspiration, and a topic

00:00:57.101 --> 00:01:01.268
in my music because of what's
happening here politically.

00:01:04.421 --> 00:01:06.920
I'm living within this
conflict constantly.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.461
I wake up in the morning to this conflict,

00:01:09.461 --> 00:01:13.378
and when something happens
I feel a part of it.

00:01:15.718 --> 00:01:18.150
I talk about my government a lot.

00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:20.931
I talk about politicians in general,

00:01:20.931 --> 00:01:25.472
and the people who have
power to make things better,

00:01:25.472 --> 00:01:29.222
and don't always do the
right thing about it.

00:01:32.131 --> 00:01:35.440
Knowing that and feeling that
I'm in the middle of this

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:39.651
is also something that
creates an inner conflict.

00:01:39.651 --> 00:01:42.068
I mean, am I involved enough?

00:01:44.488 --> 00:01:47.501
Am I doing enough in
order to change things?

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:50.584
(pounding drum beat)

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:55.389
Music has always been a way for me to deal

00:01:55.389 --> 00:01:57.781
with what's happening around me,

00:01:57.781 --> 00:01:59.305
what's happening in the world,

00:01:59.305 --> 00:02:01.377
and what's happening inside me,

00:02:01.377 --> 00:02:05.544
and it's the best form of
communication that I know

00:02:06.867 --> 00:02:09.367
from me to the outside world.

